      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "You take on the role of Ethan Granger, a seasoned private investigator
    with a troubled past. After receiving a mysterious letter about disappearances
    linked to the infamous Drakemore family estate, you travel to the outskirts of
    town to uncover the truth.\n\nThe mansion has stood abandoned for decades, but
    something still lingers within its rotting walls. As you explore, you'll uncover
    forgotten journals, strange artifacts, and twisted memories that paint a chilling
    picture of the mansion's past.\n\nEvery creak, whisper, and flicker of light
    may be more than just your imagination.\n\nYour objective is simple: Uncover
    the secret ritual that led to the family\u2019s demise\u2026 and live to tell
    the tale."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 23a2e4951b27c634f8ab472943900536, type: 2}
