  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "To complete Whispers in the Dark, you must:\n\nFind and activate three
    rotatable statues located outside the mansion. Each statue faces the house only
    after solving its associated multi-step puzzle.\n\nStatue Puzzle 1 involves finding
    the lost Drakemore family journal in a locked trunk, returning it to the bookshelf
    in the study, and accessing a hidden lever room.\n\nStatue Puzzle 2 requires
    you to locate a missing valve cap and return it to the basement pipes, which
    opens a secret chamber in the bedroom.\n\nStatue Puzzle 3 involves retrieving
    a marble from the bathroom, using it in a minigame in the bedroom, and unlocking
    a trunk containing a torn portrait to place on a pedestal.\n\nOnce all statues
    are turned to face the mansion, a hidden door opens in the main bedroom revealing
    the ritual room.\n\nWhen you enter the ritual room, a final sequence begins.
    Survive the final events to trigger the game\u2019s ending."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 23a2e4951b27c634f8ab472943900536, type: 2}
