  m_text: "W A S D \u2014 Move around the environment\n\nMouse \u2014 Look around
    and aim your view\n\nE \u2014 Interact with objects / Pick up items\n\nTAB \u2014
    Open Inventory (view collected items)\n\nLeft Shift \u2014 Run (use carefully
    \u2014 enemies may hear you)\n\nC \u2014 Crouch (use to sneak or move through
    tight spaces)\n\nEsc \u2014 Pause game / open main menu\n\n\nAll of these are
    interchangeable in the options menu"
